# 🧠 Mind Map: Student Assistant Web App

---

### 1. **Frontend (Client-side)**

| Aspect                  | Tech / Tools                                               | Purpose                                  |
| ----------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| Languages               | HTML, CSS, JavaScript                                      | UI structure, styling, and interactivity |
| UI Framework (optional) | Vanilla JS or React/Vue/etc (start simple with Vanilla JS) | For building dynamic user interfaces     |
| Voice-to-Text API       | Web Speech API                                             | Capture voice input for notes            |
| Firebase SDK            | Firebase Web SDK (Firestore, Auth, Messaging)              | Access cloud database & auth             |
| Responsive Design       | CSS Flexbox/Grid, Media Queries                            | Make app mobile-friendly                 |
| Build Tools (optional)  | VS Code, Live Server                                       | Coding & local development               |

---

### 2. **Backend (Server-side & Cloud)**

| Aspect             | Service / Tool                                           | Purpose                                          |
| ------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| Database           | Firebase Firestore                                       | Store and sync notes, attendance, timetable data |
| Authentication     | Firebase Authentication (optional)                       | Manage user accounts and secure data             |
| Hosting            | Firebase Hosting or any static hosting (Netlify, Vercel) | Serve your website globally                      |
| Push Notifications | Firebase Cloud Messaging (later phase)                   | Notify users of classes, reminders               |
| AI Services        | OpenAI API or similar                                    | Chat assistant, summarization                    |

---

### 3. **Integration**

* **Frontend uses Firebase SDK to:**

  * Read/write data to Firestore in real-time
  * Authenticate users (if implemented)
  * Receive push notifications
* **AI API calls** from frontend to OpenAI or other AI providers (via fetch or axios)

---

### 4. **Deployment**

| Step                | Description                                                |
| ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| Local Development   | Build and test your app locally with VS Code + Live Server |
| Version Control     | Use Git/GitHub to track code versions                      |
| Cloud Hosting       | Deploy frontend to Firebase Hosting or Netlify/Vercel      |
| Backend (Firestore) | Fully managed by Firebase (no server to manage)            |
| Continuous Updates  | Push code updates and redeploy to hosting                  |

---

### 5. **Future Android App**

* Wrap web app with **Capacitor** or **Cordova**
* Access native features via plugins
* Publish to Google Play Store

