### TL;DR

* **Frontend:** HTML + CSS + JS + Firebase SDK
* **Backend:** Firebase Firestore + Firebase Auth (optional) + Firebase Cloud Messaging (optional)
* **AI:** External AI API (OpenAI)
* **Hosting:** Firebase Hosting or other static hosting service
* **Deployment:** Simple push and deploy workflow with no backend server management needed

